  "goodToKnow": "Das Zubehör means accessories or equipment that belong with something: Autozubehör, Handyzubehör, Badezimmerzubehör. It's a collective noun, used in the singular: Das Zubehör ist im Preis enthalten. Note the neuter gender. It comes from zu + gehören (to belong to): what belongs to the main item. In shops, Zubehör is a section of its own. In law, Zubehör is defined in the BGB as items that serve a main thing."
